WEBVTT

00:21:59.519 --> 00:22:02.038
LS: I've always had, sort of,

00:22:02.062 --> 00:22:06.133
what I call a very performative
relationship with my clothes.

00:22:06.157 --> 00:22:12.273
I resist like crazy
social categories or constructions

00:22:12.297 --> 00:22:13.920
of who I should be.

00:22:14.276 --> 00:22:16.333
AG: In this case,
she was resisting the idea

00:22:16.357 --> 00:22:18.373
that a long time professor of social work

00:22:18.397 --> 00:22:20.617
wouldn't also be interested
in high fashion.

00:22:20.965 --> 00:22:23.966
She'd been toying with the idea
of starting a fashion blog.

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:26.685
And one day, unexpectedly,
the name came to her.

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:28.774
LS: It was the first week of school,

00:22:28.798 --> 00:22:31.289
and I always used to dress up for that.